<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Currently it is impossible to create waypoints by script, which is necessary for adding party members to the party selection screen without overriding the char_stage area.
</p><p>CreateWaypoint would also be quite useful in many other situations, such as adding patrol paths to existing areas.
</p>
